WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:04.753
- [Dan] What are you doin' with that?

00:00:04.753 --> 00:00:06.427
- Mentos and Coke, have
you see this before?

00:00:06.427 --> 00:00:07.340
- No.
- What you do, right?

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.053
You get some Coke, you get some Mentos.

00:00:14.996 --> 00:00:17.160
That's pretty cool.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:17.993
- Good.

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.193
Ready?

00:00:21.193 --> 00:00:22.443
- [Gavin] Yeah.

00:01:01.275 --> 00:01:02.108
That looked good.

00:01:02.108 --> 00:01:03.795
I liked your gnarly flip
through that stream of coke.

00:01:03.795 --> 00:01:04.628
- Yeah?

00:01:04.628 --> 00:01:05.461
- [Gavin] I wanna give that a go.

00:01:05.461 --> 00:01:06.550
I think we should do one at the same time.

00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:07.383
- Both of us?

00:01:07.383 --> 00:01:08.216
- [Gavin] But, who the hell's gonna put

00:01:08.216 --> 00:01:09.440
the Mentos in the bottle?

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:10.411
Oh, all right.

00:01:10.411 --> 00:01:11.244
- Hello.

00:01:11.244 --> 00:01:12.077
- [Gavin] This is Georgia.

00:01:12.077 --> 00:01:13.540
What is your channel called?

00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:14.740
- GB Film Productions.

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.060
- [Gavin] GB Film Productions, okay,

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:17.050
everyone should check that out.

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:18.560
There's some short films, they're cool.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.867
And have you ever put Mentos
in a coke bottle before?

00:01:20.867 --> 00:01:22.439
- Never, I've never done that before.

00:01:22.439 --> 00:01:23.690
- [Gavin] What's your approach gonna be?

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:24.523
Like what are you gonna?

00:01:24.523 --> 00:01:25.800
You gotta get as many in as possible.

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:28.040
- Yeah, I'm just gonna try
and flood it all in there

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:30.430
and see how high it can go.

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:32.290
- There's a lotta technique
to this, you know?

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:34.535
So yeah, I've been doin'
it for a few years now so.

00:01:34.535 --> 00:01:35.985
- [Georgia] Practicing, yeah.

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:38.673
- This is gonna be mega-wide.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:41.287
- [Georgia] Yeah, just
wanna have it on you.

00:01:46.196 --> 00:01:47.920
- Right, so have the funnel ready.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:50.085
Is the funnel good, yeah?

00:01:50.085 --> 00:01:50.918
- Yep.

00:01:50.918 --> 00:01:51.751
- Ready?

00:01:51.751 --> 00:01:52.584
- [Gavin] Yep.

00:01:52.584 --> 00:01:53.417
Do it.

00:01:53.417 --> 00:01:54.250
Right-O.

00:02:52.723 --> 00:02:54.214
Stop it, yeah.

00:02:54.214 --> 00:02:56.047
- [Georgia] Oh my god.

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:59.150
- So we finally filmed Mentos and Coke

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:01.430
like everyone's been asking
for for about a year.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:02.709
Thought it went rather well.

00:03:02.709 --> 00:03:05.313
Good altitude on the coke.
- Yeah.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.535
- Tryin' a Mento?

00:03:07.535 --> 00:03:08.368
- Yeah.

00:03:08.368 --> 00:03:09.280
- I've never had a Mento.
- No?

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:10.223
- I've never tried one either.

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:11.056
- I'm gonna try one like this.

00:03:11.056 --> 00:03:12.030
- Mine's all hard.

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:14.037
- Mine's kind of wet and sticky.

00:03:16.295 --> 00:03:17.870
- Are you tryin' to get
one from the bottom?

00:03:17.870 --> 00:03:20.040
- It went down my throat like.

00:03:20.040 --> 00:03:21.070
- I think puttin' them in Diet Coke

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:22.250
