00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.429
- Yeah, I think that's.
- That's their only good use.

00:03:23.429 --> 00:03:24.262
- It's the most of efficient use of that.

00:03:24.262 --> 00:03:25.919
- These definitely weren't.

00:03:25.919 --> 00:03:28.782
They weren't designed for
consumption, I don't think.

00:03:28.782 --> 00:03:30.290
- No.

00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:31.540
- See ya in the next one.

